<form id="spec-form" class="spec-form" novalidate>
  <div class="field">
    <label for="ram">RAM sistem (GB)</label>
    <input id="ram" name="ram" type="number" inputmode="decimal" required min="<%= limits.ramGb.min %>" max="<%= limits.ramGb.max %>" step="0.5">
    <p class="hint" id="ram-hint">Browser membatasi nilai RAM maksimal 8 GB. Koreksi bila perangkat Anda memiliki lebih.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <label for="gpu-renderer">GPU terdeteksi</label>
    <input id="gpu-renderer" name="gpuRenderer" type="text" maxlength="<%= limits.rendererMaxLength %>" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" readonly>
    <p class="hint">Dibaca dari browser. Kosong bila browser menyembunyikannya.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <label for="vram">VRAM GPU (GB)</label>
    <input id="vram" name="vram" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="<%= limits.vramGb.min %>" max="<%= limits.vramGb.max %>" step="0.5">
    <p class="hint" id="vram-hint">Kosongkan atau isi 0 bila tidak ada GPU diskrit.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <label for="cores">Jumlah core CPU</label>
    <input id="cores" name="cores" type="number" inputmode="numeric" required min="<%= limits.cores.min %>" max="<%= limits.cores.max %>" step="1">
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <label for="os">Sistem operasi</label>
    <select id="os" name="os" required>
      <% osOptions.forEach(function (value) { %>
      <option value="<%= value %>"><%= osLabels[value] %></option>
      <% }) %>
    </select>
  </div>
  <div class="field field-check">
    <input id="unified" name="unified" type="checkbox">
    <label for="unified">Memori terpadu (Apple Silicon)</label>
  </div>
  <div class="form-actions">
    <button type="submit" class="button">Cocokkan model</button>
  </div>
  <p id="form-error" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
</form>
<details class="help">
  <summary>Cara mengecek spesifikasi secara manual</summary>
  <ul>
    <li>Windows: Task Manager, tab Performance, lihat Memory dan GPU (Dedicated GPU memory).</li>
    <li>macOS: menu Apple, About This Mac, lihat Memory.</li>
    <li>Linux: jalankan <code>free -h</code> untuk RAM dan <code>nvidia-smi</code> untuk VRAM kartu NVIDIA.</li>
  </ul>
</details>
